pbwinput 1
# Frigate's test launcher after an app closed by a touch (ctest launch_touch_then_party, port/cmake/oracle.cmake), on
# the port alone, from the starter save, with --launch card,party@4044: continue's presses take CONTINUE to the field,
# where the launcher opens the trainer card at once (count 3437); a touch on its return button closes it, which sets
# the UI's touch flag (src/ov186/trainer_card.c); the party list then opens at count 4044, as in the party_menus route,
# and must show the oracle's screen of that route at count 4250, which the DS shows after the field menu's choice by a
# key; B closes it. On game frames. Black 2.
version b2_us
# START in the opening skips it to the title
1100 START
1101 -
# START brings back the layers the title hid
3000 START
3001 -
# START leaves for the start menu
3100 START
3101 -
# CONTINUE
3400 A
3401 -
# The pen on the card's return button (its rect: lines 168-192, columns 228-252)
3700 - 240,180
3706 -
# B: the party list closes after its screen at count 4250
4280 B
4286 -
